    - target: {fileID: 3942304042872357358, guid: edec39da6b5fcc4469939a92f5118ff1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: I might not remember everything. But I won't erase them anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3942304042872357358, guid: edec39da6b5fcc4469939a92f5118ff1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: I'm sorry Sharon. I tried to forget you. I tried to erase my mistake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3942304042872357358, guid: edec39da6b5fcc4469939a92f5118ff1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: I know you wouldn't want me to live like this. I'll try to live on,
        I wouldn't make the same mistake again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3942304042872357358, guid: edec39da6b5fcc4469939a92f5118ff1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: What shall I do now?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
